CB008015-ET-A60_A_B10_online modification of carrierAggregationSupportList and sCellAdditionMethod
    [Documentation]
    ...    1. The purpose of this test case is to verify online modification with A1 measurement SCell change for SA call(RSRP)
    ...    CA relationships: FDD have 4 NRREL MO
    ...    The weighted cell bandwidth is configured as : Cell 1>Cell 2>Cell 11+ cell13>Cell 13>Cell 11
    ...    UE81: support n66+n71,n71+n41,n66+n41,n66+n78; n41+n78,n71+n78,n66+n66+n71 CA . n66 is pcell in this case .
